{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">亞運七人欖球，港隊擊敗國家隊，達成三連霸，奪香港今屆第11金。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.AG.RUGBY-0100.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026zNL7IkJr6Z1791069064.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.AG.RUGBY-0100.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港隊男子七欖，四強大勝韓國晉級，決賽面對國家隊，半場領先21-0，下半場維持不失，最終贏26-0奪金，連續三屆封王，是港隊今屆第11面金牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.AG.RUGBY-0100_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026E3VwCZLRHD1791069092.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.AG.RUGBY-0100_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">女子港隊就在銅牌戰險勝泰國，港隊總獎牌數達54面，破歷屆紀錄。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T23:58:08.249077+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}